#: cli/doctor.php
#, php-format
msgid "Available repairs: %s"
msgstr "Marekebisho yanayopatikana: %s"

#: cli/doctor.php
#, php-format
msgid "Unknown format %s. Use text, json, nagios, or prometheus."
msgstr "Muundo usiojulikana %s. Tumia text, json, nagios, au prometheus."

#: cli/doctor.php
#, php-format
msgid "Redaction could not complete, so %s was not written."
msgstr "Ufichaji wa taarifa nyeti haukuweza kukamilika, kwa hivyo %s haikuandikwa."

#: cli/doctor.php
#, php-format
msgid "Wrote %s. Review it before sharing; values after password, secret, token, and community names are masked."
msgstr "Imeandika %s. Ikague kabla ya kushiriki; thamani baada ya majina ya password, secret, token, na community zimefichwa."

#: cli/doctor.php doctor_functions.php
msgid "Unknown repair"
msgstr "Rekebisho lisilojulikana"

#: cli/doctor.php
msgid "Refusing to repair without --yes."
msgstr "Inakataa kurekebisha bila --yes."

#: cli/doctor.php
msgid "Select a supported symptom and text or JSON output."
msgstr "Chagua dalili inayotumika na matokeo ya text au JSON."

#: cli/doctor.php doctor_web.php
msgid "Accepted warning"
msgstr "Onyo lililokubaliwa"

#: doctor_access.php doctor_functions.php
msgid "Device availability"
msgstr "Upatikanaji wa kifaa"

#: doctor_access.php
msgid "Device permissions could not be evaluated."
msgstr "Ruhusa za kifaa hazikuweza kutathminiwa."

#: doctor_access.php
msgid "The configured PHP CLI cannot run Doctor checks."
msgstr "PHP CLI iliyosanidiwa haiwezi kuendesha ukaguzi wa Doctor."

#: doctor_access.php
msgid "Doctor checks failed or exceeded their time limit. Review the Doctor log."
msgstr "Ukaguzi wa Doctor ulishindwa au ulizidi kikomo chake cha muda. Kagua kumbukumbu ya Doctor."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Graphs stopped updating"
msgstr "Grafu zimeacha kusasishwa"

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Polling is slow"
msgstr "Ukusanyaji data (polling) ni wa polepole"

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Devices are missing or unavailable"
msgstr "Vifaa vinakosekana au havipatikani"

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Doctor alerts are missing"
msgstr "Tahadhari za Doctor hazipo"

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Check the poller scheduler and the affected poller log, then verify a new completed cycle."
msgstr "Kagua kiratibu cha poller na kumbukumbu ya poller iliyoathiriwa, kisha thibitisha mzunguko mpya uliokamilika."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Collection may have stopped."
msgstr "Ukusanyaji huenda umesimama."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Collected values may not be reaching disk."
msgstr "Thamani zilizokusanywa huenda hazifiki kwenye diski."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Inspect the output queue and Boost flush history; verify that the queue drains and RRD timestamps advance."
msgstr "Chunguza foleni ya matokeo na historia ya usafishaji wa Boost; thibitisha kuwa foleni inapungua na alama za muda za RRD zinasonga mbele."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Check storage capacity, runtime-directory permissions and the last RRD update; account for deferred writes."
msgstr "Kagua uwezo wa hifadhi, ruhusa za saraka ya utekelezaji na sasisho la mwisho la RRD; zingatia maandishi yaliyoahirishwa."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "RRD storage needs investigation."
msgstr "Hifadhi ya RRD inahitaji uchunguzi."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Collection work may be exceeding its time budget."
msgstr "Kazi ya ukusanyaji huenda inazidi muda uliopangwa."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Compare cycle duration with the polling interval and inspect device timeouts before increasing concurrency."
msgstr "Linganisha muda wa mzunguko na muda wa kipindi cha polling na uchunguze muda wa kusubiri wa kifaa kabla ya kuongeza uendeshaji sambamba."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Compare database counters during a slow cycle and inspect query plans before changing server limits."
msgstr "Linganisha vihesabu vya hifadhidata wakati wa mzunguko wa polepole na uchunguze mipango ya hoja kabla ya kubadilisha vikomo vya seva."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Database pressure may be contributing to slow polling."
msgstr "Shinikizo la hifadhidata huenda linachangia polling ya polepole."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Collection prerequisites or reachability may be failing."
msgstr "Mahitaji ya awali ya ukusanyaji au ufikikaji huenda vinashindwa."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Verify the affected device permissions, reachability, credentials and assigned poller using Cacti diagnostics."
msgstr "Thibitisha ruhusa za kifaa kilichoathiriwa, ufikikaji, vitambulisho na poller iliyotengwa kwa kutumia uchunguzi wa Cacti."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Scheduled checks or mail delivery need attention."
msgstr "Ukaguzi uliopangwa au uwasilishaji wa barua pepe unahitaji uangalizi."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Verify scheduling and recipient settings, inspect retained delivery attempts, and send a Cacti test email."
msgstr "Thibitisha mipangilio ya ratiba na wapokeaji, chunguza majaribio ya uwasilishaji yaliyohifadhiwa, na utume barua pepe ya majaribio ya Cacti."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "Possible causes require verification; matching checks do not establish a root cause."
msgstr "Sababu zinazowezekana zinahitaji uthibitisho; ukaguzi unaolingana hauthibitishi chanzo kikuu."

#: doctor_diagnosis.php
msgid "No cause is established by the available observations. Run fresh diagnostics and investigate the symptom directly."
msgstr "Hakuna chanzo kilichothibitishwa na uchunguzi uliopo. Endesha uchunguzi mpya na uchunguze dalili moja kwa moja."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "At least 24 hours since server startup and FLUSH STATUS. Counters are cumulative and may have different reset histories; confirm trends during a representative workload before tuning."
msgstr "Angalau saa 24 tangu kuanza kwa seva na FLUSH STATUS. Vihesabu ni vya mkusanyiko na huenda vikawa na historia tofauti za kuweka upya; thibitisha mielekeo wakati wa mzigo wa kazi unaowakilisha kabla ya kurekebisha."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Cumulative tuning advice is deferred: obtain valid uptime and at least 24 hours since startup and FLUSH STATUS. Missing metrics or an inconsistent sample cannot establish database health."
msgstr "Ushauri wa urekebishaji wa mkusanyiko umeahirishwa: pata muda halali wa kufanya kazi na angalau saa 24 tangu kuanza na FLUSH STATUS. Vipimo vinavyokosekana au sampuli isiyolingana haviwezi kuthibitisha afya ya hifadhidata."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Database observation window"
msgstr "Dirisha la uchunguzi wa hifadhidata"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Connection metrics are unavailable or invalid. Check access to SHOW GLOBAL STATUS and SHOW GLOBAL VARIABLES; do not treat missing metrics as an idle server."
msgstr "Vipimo vya muunganisho havipatikani au si sahihi. Kagua ufikiaji wa SHOW GLOBAL STATUS na SHOW GLOBAL VARIABLES; usichukulie vipimo vinavyokosekana kama seva isiyo na shughuli."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Current connections: %.0f / %.0f (%s); recorded peak: %.0f (%s of the current limit)."
msgstr "Miunganisho ya sasa: %.0f / %.0f (%s); kilele kilichorekodiwa: %.0f (%s ya kikomo cha sasa)."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Review connection pooling and poller concurrency. Check database-host memory headroom before raising max_connections; the historical peak may reflect an older limit."
msgstr "Kagua mkusanyiko wa miunganisho na uendeshaji sambamba wa poller. Kagua nafasi ya kumbukumbu ya seva mwenyeji ya hifadhidata kabla ya kuongeza max_connections; kilele cha kihistoria huenda kikaakisi kikomo cha zamani."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Connection capacity"
msgstr "Uwezo wa miunganisho"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "InnoDB buffer pool reads"
msgstr "Usomaji wa InnoDB buffer pool"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Review query plans and the working set. Consider innodb_buffer_pool_size only after measuring memory available on the database host; a cumulative miss ratio alone does not prove memory pressure."
msgstr "Kagua mipango ya hoja na seti ya kazi. Zingatia innodb_buffer_pool_size tu baada ya kupima kumbukumbu inayopatikana kwenye seva mwenyeji ya hifadhidata; uwiano wa ukosefu wa mkusanyiko pekee hauthibitishi shinikizo la kumbukumbu."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "On-disk temporary tables"
msgstr "Majedwali ya muda kwenye diski"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Review query plans, sorting, grouping, and temporary-table data types before changing memory limits. Some tables must use disk; memory limits and accounting differ between MySQL and MariaDB versions."
msgstr "Kagua mipango ya hoja, upangaji, uunganishaji katika makundi, na aina za data za majedwali ya muda kabla ya kubadilisha vikomo vya kumbukumbu. Baadhi ya majedwali lazima yatumie diski; vikomo vya kumbukumbu na uhesabuji hutofautiana kati ya matoleo ya MySQL na MariaDB."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Connection thread creation"
msgstr "Uundaji wa nyuzi za muunganisho"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Review connection reuse and thread_cache_size. Check the server thread-handling mode before tuning; thread-pool implementations do not behave like one-thread-per-connection servers."
msgstr "Kagua matumizi tena ya miunganisho na thread_cache_size. Kagua hali ya ushughulikiaji wa nyuzi za seva kabla ya kurekebisha; utekelezaji wa thread-pool haufanyi kazi kama seva za uzi mmoja kwa kila muunganisho."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Review slow-query logging, long_query_time, and query plans before changing server buffers. This counter depends on the configured slow-query threshold and does not identify individual statements."
msgstr "Kagua uwekaji kumbukumbu wa hoja za polepole, long_query_time, na mipango ya hoja kabla ya kubadilisha bafa za seva. Kihesabu hiki kinategemea kizingiti cha hoja za polepole kilichowekwa na hakitambui kauli mojamoja."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Slow statements"
msgstr "Kauli za polepole"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Cumulative advice deferred until the observation window is sufficient."
msgstr "Ushauri wa mkusanyiko umeahirishwa hadi dirisha la uchunguzi liwe la kutosha."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Thread-cache advice is not assessed: thread_handling is unavailable or is not one-thread-per-connection. Review the active thread-pool implementation instead."
msgstr "Ushauri wa thread-cache haujatathminiwa: thread_handling haipatikani au si ya uzi mmoja kwa kila muunganisho. Kagua utekelezaji wa thread-pool unaotumika badala yake."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Required counters are missing or invalid: %s, %s. Check server-version support and monitoring permissions."
msgstr "Vihesabu vinavyohitajika vinakosekana au si sahihi: %s, %s. Kagua usaidizi wa toleo la seva na ruhusa za ufuatiliaji."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "A counter reset since the prior sample; collect another representative interval before tuning."
msgstr "Kihesabu kimewekwa upya tangu sampuli iliyotangulia; kusanya kipindi kingine kinachowakilisha kabla ya kurekebisha."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Insufficient activity: %.0f %s; at least %d observations are needed for this advisory."
msgstr "Shughuli haitoshi: %.0f %s; angalau uchunguzi %d unahitajika kwa ushauri huu."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Counters are inconsistent or were reset independently. Collect a new representative sample before tuning."
msgstr "Vihesabu havilingani au viliwekwa upya kwa kujitegemea. Kusanya sampuli mpya inayowakilisha kabla ya kurekebisha."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "The interval sample is too small or counters reset; collect another representative interval before tuning."
msgstr "Sampuli ya kipindi ni ndogo sana au vihesabu vimewekwa upya; kusanya kipindi kingine kinachowakilisha kabla ya kurekebisha."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Interval %s / %s: %.0f / %.0f (%s); investigation threshold: %s."
msgstr "Kipindi %s / %s: %.0f / %.0f (%s); kizingiti cha uchunguzi: %s."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Cumulative %s / %s: %.0f / %.0f (%s); investigation threshold: %s."
msgstr "Mkusanyiko %s / %s: %.0f / %.0f (%s); kizingiti cha uchunguzi: %s."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "This counter can omit memory-mapped temporary files on MySQL; a low ratio does not rule out disk use."
msgstr "Kihesabu hiki kinaweza kuruka faili za muda zilizopangwa kwenye kumbukumbu kwenye MySQL; uwiano mdogo hauondoi uwezekano wa matumizi ya diski."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Redo-log advice deferred until the observation window is sufficient and Innodb_log_waits is available."
msgstr "Ushauri wa redo-log umeahirishwa hadi dirisha la uchunguzi liwe la kutosha na Innodb_log_waits ipatikane."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Cumulative Innodb_log_waits: %.0f."
msgstr "Mkusanyiko wa Innodb_log_waits: %.0f."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Investigate transaction sizes, log-buffer pressure, and storage latency. Recheck the rate under load before considering innodb_log_buffer_size; this historical count is not evidence of a current stall."
msgstr "Chunguza ukubwa wa miamala, shinikizo la log-buffer, na ucheleweshaji wa hifadhi. Kagua tena kiwango chini ya mzigo kabla ya kuzingatia innodb_log_buffer_size; idadi hii ya kihistoria si ushahidi wa kusimama kwa sasa."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "InnoDB log-buffer waits"
msgstr "Kusubiri kwa InnoDB log-buffer"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "installed Cacti composer.json"
msgstr "composer.json ya Cacti iliyosakinishwa"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Cacti %s installer requirement"
msgstr "Mahitaji ya kisakinishi cha Cacti %s"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "PHP compatibility with installed Cacti"
msgstr "Upatanifu wa PHP na Cacti iliyosakinishwa"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Running PHP %s; installed Cacti %s."
msgstr "PHP inayotumika %s; Cacti iliyosakinishwa %s."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Could not establish Cacti's PHP requirement. Check the installed Cacti composer.json or release documentation; Doctor does not assume compatibility."
msgstr "Haikuweza kuthibitisha mahitaji ya PHP ya Cacti. Kagua composer.json ya Cacti iliyosakinishwa au nyaraka za toleo; Doctor haikadirii upatanifu."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "PHP >= %s and < %s"
msgstr "PHP >= %s na < %s"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "PHP >= %s"
msgstr "PHP >= %s"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Requires %s (%s). Running PHP meets that requirement."
msgstr "Inahitaji %s (%s). PHP inayotumika inatimiza hitaji hilo."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Requires %s (%s). Running PHP does not meet that requirement."
msgstr "Inahitaji %s (%s). PHP inayotumika haitimizi hitaji hilo."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Detected %s; Doctor requires Cacti 1.2.20 or newer."
msgstr "Imegunduliwa %s; Doctor inahitaji Cacti 1.2.20 au mpya zaidi."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Supported Cacti version"
msgstr "Toleo la Cacti linaloungwa mkono"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "PHP upstream security support"
msgstr "Usaidizi wa usalama wa chanzo wa PHP"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "This checks the PHP release branch, not whether this patch release is up to date or whether your OS vendor backports fixes. Cacti compatibility is checked separately."
msgstr "Hii inakagua tawi la toleo la PHP, si kama toleo hili la kiraka limesasishwa au kama mchuuzi wako wa OS anarudisha marekebisho nyuma. Upatanifu wa Cacti unakaguliwa kando."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Running PHP %s; upstream security-support status is unknown or this is a prerelease. Check https://www.php.net/supported-versions.php and update Doctor's support data."
msgstr "PHP inayotumika %s; hali ya usaidizi wa usalama kutoka chanzo haijulikani au hili ni toleo la awali. Kagua https://www.php.net/supported-versions.php na usasishe data ya usaidizi ya Doctor."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Running PHP %s; PHP %s receives upstream security fixes through %s."
msgstr "PHP inayotumika %s; PHP %s inapokea marekebisho ya usalama kutoka chanzo hadi %s."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Running PHP %s; PHP %s no longer receives upstream security fixes; support ended %s. Upgrade to a supported PHP branch compatible with your Cacti installation, or confirm security maintenance with your OS vendor."
msgstr "PHP inayotumika %s; PHP %s haipokei tena marekebisho ya usalama kutoka chanzo; usaidizi uliisha %s. Pandisha daraja hadi tawi la PHP linaloungwa mkono na linalopatana na usakinishaji wako wa Cacti, au thibitisha matengenezo ya usalama na mchuuzi wako wa OS."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Required current CLI PHP extensions"
msgstr "Viendelezi vya sasa vya CLI PHP vinavyohitajika"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Required web PHP extensions"
msgstr "Viendelezi vya wavuti vya PHP vinavyohitajika"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Missing: %s. Install them through the operating system package manager."
msgstr "Vinakosekana: %s. Visakinishe kupitia kidhibiti vifurushi cha mfumo wa uendeshaji."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "All PHP extensions required by the Cacti installer are loaded in this PHP context."
msgstr "Viendelezi vyote vya PHP vinavyohitajika na kisakinishi cha Cacti vimepakiwa katika muktadha huu wa PHP."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Doctor does not execute configured binaries while running as root."
msgstr "Doctor haitekelezi faili za programu zilizowekwa inapoendeshwa kama root."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "The file name %s is not expected for %s, so Doctor did not execute it."
msgstr "Jina la faili %s halikutarajiwa kwa %s, kwa hivyo Doctor haikulitekeleza."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Doctor is running as root, so permission checks describe root rather than the web server or poller account, configured binaries are not executed, and repairs are refused. Run Doctor as the Cacti poller user."
msgstr "Doctor inaendeshwa kama root, kwa hivyo ukaguzi wa ruhusa unaelezea root badala ya seva ya wavuti au akaunti ya poller, faili za programu zilizowekwa hazitekelezwi, na marekebisho yanakataliwa. Endesha Doctor kama mtumiaji wa Cacti poller."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Doctor privileges"
msgstr "Haki za Doctor"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Doctor is running without root privileges."
msgstr "Doctor inaendeshwa bila haki za root."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Required CLI PHP extensions"
msgstr "Viendelezi vya CLI PHP vinavyohitajika"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "The configured PHP CLI executable is unavailable, so its extensions cannot be checked."
msgstr "Programu ya PHP CLI iliyowekwa haipatikani, kwa hivyo viendelezi vyake haviwezi kukaguliwa."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "shell_exec() is disabled, so Doctor cannot compare the CLI PHP extensions with Cacti requirements."
msgstr "shell_exec() imelemazwa, kwa hivyo Doctor haiwezi kulinganisha viendelezi vya CLI PHP na mahitaji ya Cacti."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "The configured PHP CLI executable did not return a valid extension list."
msgstr "Programu ya PHP CLI iliyowekwa haikurudisha orodha halali ya viendelezi."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Missing from CLI PHP: %s. The web and CLI PHP configurations are separate on many systems."
msgstr "Vinakosekana kwenye CLI PHP: %s. Mipangilio ya PHP ya wavuti na CLI iko kando kwenye mifumo mingi."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "The configured PHP CLI has every extension required by Cacti."
msgstr "PHP CLI iliyowekwa ina kila kiendelezi kinachohitajika na Cacti."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "GD TrueType support"
msgstr "Usaidizi wa GD TrueType"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Recommended PHP features"
msgstr "Vipengele vya PHP vinavyopendekezwa"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Unavailable: %s. Cacti can run without these features, but related functionality may be limited."
msgstr "Havipatikani: %s. Cacti inaweza kufanya kazi bila vipengele hivi, lakini utendakazi unaohusiana unaweza kuwa na kikomo."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "The optional gettext, SNMP, and GD TrueType features are available."
msgstr "Vipengele vya hiari vya gettext, SNMP, na GD TrueType vinapatikana."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "memory_limit is %s (%dM or more is recommended)"
msgstr "memory_limit ni %s (%dM au zaidi inapendekezwa)"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "max_execution_time is %d seconds (60 or more is recommended)"
msgstr "max_execution_time ni sekunde %d (60 au zaidi inapendekezwa)"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "date.timezone is not set"
msgstr "date.timezone haijawekwa"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "unset"
msgstr "haijawekwa"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s. Current values: %s"
msgstr "%s. Thamani za sasa: %s"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "PHP runtime configuration"
msgstr "Mipangilio ya utekelezaji ya PHP"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Database connection"
msgstr "Muunganisho wa hifadhidata"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Query failed: %s"
msgstr "Hoja imeshindwa: %s"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "A read-only query completed successfully."
msgstr "Hoja ya kusoma tu imekamilika kwa mafanikio."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "The database returned an unexpected result."
msgstr "Hifadhidata ilirudisha matokeo yasiyotarajiwa."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Doctor could not determine the database server version from %s."
msgstr "Doctor haikuweza kubaini toleo la seva ya hifadhidata kutoka %s."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Supported database server"
msgstr "Seva ya hifadhidata inayoungwa mkono"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s %s detected; this Cacti branch recommends %s %s or newer."
msgstr "%s %s imegunduliwa; tawi hili la Cacti linapendekeza %s %s au mpya zaidi."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Database character set is %s and collation is %s. Cacti requires utf8mb4."
msgstr "Seti ya herufi ya hifadhidata ni %s na collation ni %s. Cacti inahitaji utf8mb4."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "unknown"
msgstr "haijulikani"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Database character set"
msgstr "Seti ya herufi ya hifadhidata"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Database timezone support"
msgstr "Usaidizi wa saa za eneo za hifadhidata"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "The Cacti database account cannot read mysql.time_zone_name. Grant SELECT access and populate the database timezone tables."
msgstr "Akaunti ya hifadhidata ya Cacti haiwezi kusoma mysql.time_zone_name. Toa ruhusa ya SELECT na ujaze majedwali ya saa za eneo ya hifadhidata."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "The database timezone table is accessible and contains %d entries."
msgstr "Jedwali la saa za eneo la hifadhidata linafikika na lina maingizo %d."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "The database timezone table is accessible but empty. Populate the system timezone tables."
msgstr "Jedwali la saa za eneo la hifadhidata linafikika lakini ni tupu. Jaza majedwali ya saa za eneo ya mfumo."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Core tables used by Cacti are present."
msgstr "Majedwali ya msingi yanayotumiwa na Cacti yapo."

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Missing core tables: %s. Restore or upgrade the database before attempting other repairs."
msgstr "Majedwali ya msingi yanayokosekana: %s. Rejesha au upandishe daraja hifadhidata kabla ya kujaribu marekebisho mengine."

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Core database tables"
msgstr "Majedwali ya msingi ya hifadhidata"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s is missing (%s)"
msgstr "%s haipo (%s)"

#: doctor_functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s is not writable (%s)"
msgstr "%s haiwezi kuandikwa (%s)"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "Runtime directories"
msgstr "Saraka za utekelezaji"

#: doctor_functions.php
msgid "The cache, log, and RRA directories exist and are writable."
