msgid "%d check transitions await delivery; attempts: %d of 3."
msgstr "Mabadiliko %d ya ukaguzi yanasubiri kuwasilishwa; majaribio: %d kati ya 3."

#: doctor_scheduling.php
msgid "Automatic retries exhausted. Correct Cacti mail settings, then run Doctor with --scheduled --retry-alerts as the poller user."
msgstr "Majaribio ya kiotomatiki yameisha. Rekebisha mipangilio ya barua pepe ya Cacti, kisha endesha Doctor na --scheduled --retry-alerts kama mtumiaji wa kikusanyaji."

#: doctor_scheduling.php
#, php-format
msgid "Next eligible retry: %s UTC, after a primary poller cycle."
msgstr "Jaribio linalofuata linalostahiki: %s UTC, baada ya mzunguko wa kikusanyaji kikuu."

#: doctor_scheduling.php
msgid "No alert recipients are currently configured; pending transitions are retained."
msgstr "Hakuna wapokeaji wa tahadhari waliowekwa kwa sasa; mabadiliko yanayosubiri yanahifadhiwa."

#: doctor_scheduling.php
msgid "No retained alert is awaiting delivery. Mail-server acceptance does not prove inbox delivery."
msgstr "Hakuna tahadhari iliyohifadhiwa inayosubiri kuwasilishwa. Kukubaliwa na seva ya barua pepe hakuthibitishi kuwasilishwa kwenye kikasha."

#: doctor_scheduling.php
msgid "Doctor retained status changes (UTC). Repeated changes for one check are coalesced; an out-and-back transition is retained."
msgstr "Doctor imehifadhi mabadiliko ya hali (UTC). Mabadiliko yanayorudiwa kwa ukaguzi mmoja yanaunganishwa; badiliko la kwenda na kurudi linahifadhiwa."

#: doctor_scheduling.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s: %s -> %s (latest change %s)"
msgstr "%s: %s -> %s (badiliko la hivi karibuni zaidi %s)"

#: doctor_scheduling.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d further status changes are not listed because the alert queue reached its storage limit."
msgstr "Mabadiliko %d zaidi ya hali hayajaorodheshwa kwa sababu foleni ya tahadhari imefikia kikomo chake cha uhifadhi."

#: doctor_scheduling.php
msgid "Open Utilities > Doctor for current measurements, recommended actions, and verification steps."
msgstr "Fungua Zana > Doctor kwa vipimo vya sasa, hatua zinazopendekezwa, na hatua za uthibitishaji."

#: doctor_scheduling.php
#, php-format
msgid "Cacti Doctor: %d retained status changes"
msgstr "Cacti Doctor: mabadiliko %d ya hali yaliyohifadhiwa"

#: doctor_scheduling.php
msgid "Doctor schedule is already running or the database lock is unavailable."
msgstr "Ratiba ya Doctor tayari inaendeshwa au kufuli la hifadhidata halipatikani."

#: doctor_web.php
msgid "The finding could not be acknowledged. Run Doctor again, then acknowledge the current result."
msgstr "Matokeo hayakuweza kuthibitishwa. Endesha Doctor tena, kisha thibitisha tokeo la sasa."

#: doctor_web.php
msgid "The warning exception could not be saved. Use a fresh assessed warning, an owner, a reason and an expiry within 90 days."
msgstr "Kighairi cha onyo hakikuweza kuhifadhiwa. Tumia onyo jipya lililotathminiwa, mmiliki, sababu na muda wa mwisho ndani ya siku 90."

#: doctor_web.php
msgid "Confirm repair"
msgstr "Thibitisha urekebishaji"

#: doctor_web.php
msgid "Approval expires after five minutes and is invalidated by a changed filesystem. The acting account must be able to create directories or change owner permissions."
msgstr "Idhini huisha muda baada ya dakika tano na hubatilishwa na mfumo wa faili uliobadilika. Akaunti inayofanya kazi lazima iweze kuunda saraka au kubadilisha ruhusa za mmiliki."

#: doctor_web.php
msgid "Repair prerequisites are not met. No changes will be made."
msgstr "Mahitaji ya awali ya urekebishaji hayajatimizwa. Hakuna mabadiliko yatakayofanywa."

#: doctor_web.php
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Ghairi"

