msgstr "Endesha Ukaguzi kwa Ratiba"

#: setup.php
msgid "Run every Doctor check in the background after the poller and record each check's status."
msgstr "Endesha kila ukaguzi wa Doctor chinichini baada ya kikusanyaji na urekodi hali ya kila ukaguzi."

#: setup.php
msgid "Check Interval"
msgstr "Muda wa Ukaguzi"

#: setup.php
msgid "How often the scheduled checks run."
msgstr "Mara ngapi ukaguzi ulioratibiwa huendeshwa."

#: setup.php
msgid "Every 15 Minutes"
msgstr "Kila Dakika 15"

#: setup.php
msgid "Every Hour"
msgstr "Kila Saa"

#: setup.php
msgid "Every 6 Hours"
msgstr "Kila Saa 6"

#: setup.php
msgid "Every Day"
msgstr "Kila Siku"

#: setup.php
msgid "Alert Email Addresses"
msgstr "Anwani za Barua Pepe za Tahadhari"

#: setup.php
msgid "Comma-separated addresses to email when a check starts or stops failing. Leave empty to only log changes to the Cacti log."
msgstr "Anwani zilizotenganishwa kwa koma za kutumiwa barua pepe ukaguzi unapoanza au kuacha kushindwa. Acha wazi ili kurekodi mabadiliko kwenye kumbukumbu ya Cacti pekee."

#: setup.php
msgid "Alert on Warnings"
msgstr "Tahadharisha kuhusu Maonyo"

#: setup.php
msgid "Also alert when a check moves into or out of a warning."
msgstr "Pia tahadharisha ukaguzi unapoingia au kutoka kwenye onyo."

#: setup.php
msgid "Thresholds"
msgstr "Viwango vya ukomo"

#: setup.php
msgid "Poller Run Time Warning (percent)"
msgstr "Onyo la Muda wa Kuendesha Poller (asilimia)"

#: setup.php
msgid "Warn when the last main-poller run used this share of the polling interval. Runs that take the whole interval always fail."
msgstr "Onya uendeshaji wa mwisho wa poller kuu ulipotumia sehemu hii ya muda wa ukaguzi. Uendeshaji unaotumia muda wote daima hushindwa."

#: setup.php
msgid "RRA Disk Free Warning (percent)"
msgstr "Onyo la Nafasi Huru ya Diski ya RRA (asilimia)"

#: setup.php
msgid "Warn when free space on the RRA file system drops below this percentage."
msgstr "Onya nafasi huru kwenye mfumo wa faili wa RRA inaposhuka chini ya asilimia hii."

#: setup.php
msgid "Fail when free space on the RRA file system drops below this percentage."
msgstr "Shindwa nafasi huru kwenye mfumo wa faili wa RRA inaposhuka chini ya asilimia hii."

#: setup.php
msgid "RRA Disk Free Failure (percent)"
msgstr "Kushindwa kwa Nafasi Huru ya Diski ya RRA (asilimia)"

#: setup.php
msgid "Clock Drift Warning (seconds)"
msgstr "Onyo la Tofauti ya Saa (sekunde)"

#: setup.php
msgid "Warn when the database and PHP clocks differ by more than this."
msgstr "Onya saa za hifadhidata na PHP zinapotofautiana kwa zaidi ya hapa."

#: setup.php
msgid "Clock Drift Failure (seconds)"
msgstr "Kushindwa kwa Tofauti ya Saa (sekunde)"

#: setup.php
msgid "Fail when the database and PHP clocks differ by more than this."
msgstr "Shindwa saa za hifadhidata na PHP zinapotofautiana kwa zaidi ya hapa."

#: setup.php
msgid "RRD Stale Intervals"
msgstr "Vipindi vya RRD Bila Usasishaji"

#: setup.php
msgid "Warn after this many collection intervals without a file update (1 to 100)."
msgstr "Onya baada ya vipindi hivi vingi vya ukusanyaji bila kusasishwa kwa faili (1 hadi 100)."

#: setup.php
msgid "Additional disk-write delay for external caching (0 to 86400). Boost adds its own allowance."
msgstr "Ucheleweshaji wa ziada wa kuandika kwenye diski kwa kuhifadhi kwa muda nje (0 hadi 86400). Boost huongeza muda wake wa ziada."

#: setup.php
msgid "Deferred RRD Write Allowance (seconds)"
msgstr "Muda wa Ruhusa ya Uandishi wa RRD Uliocheleweshwa (sekunde)"

#: setup.php
msgid "Cacti Log Size Warning (MB)"
msgstr "Onyo la Ukubwa wa Kumbukumbu ya Cacti (MB)"

#: setup.php
msgid "Warn when the Cacti log grows beyond this size, which usually means log rotation is not running."
msgstr "Onya kumbukumbu ya Cacti inapokua zaidi ya ukubwa huu, jambo ambalo kwa kawaida humaanisha mzunguko wa kumbukumbu hauendeshwi."
